  "content": "[Intro]\n[F]\n\n[Pre-Verse]\n[Bb]\n[F]\n[Bb]\n[F]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Bb]Hello operator\n[F]Can you give me number nine?\n[Bb]Can I see you later?\n[F]Will you give me back my dime?\n[Bb]Turn the oscillator\n[F]Twist it with a dollar bill\n[Bb]Mailman, bring the paper\n[F]Leave it on my window sill\n\n[Break]\n[Bb]\n[Db]  [Ab]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Bb]  [Db]  [Ab]\n[Eb]  [Db]  [Ab]\n[Bb]  [Ab]  [G]\n[F]  [Db]  [Ab]\n[Bb]  [Db]  [Ab]\n[Eb]  [Db]  [Ab]\n[Bb]  [Eb]  [E5]\n[F]\n\n[Pre-Verse]\n[Bb]\n[F]\n[Bb]\n[F]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Bb]Find a canary\n[F]A bird to bring my message home\n[Bb]Carry my obituary\n[F]My coffin doesn't have a phone\n[Bb]How you gonna get the money?\n[F]Send papers to an empty home?\n[Bb]How you gonna get the money?\n[F]Nobody to answer the phone\n\n[Break]\n[Bb]\n[Db]  [Ab]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Bb]  [Db]  [Ab]\n[Eb]  [Db]  [Ab]\n[Bb]  [Ab]  [G]\n[F]  [Db]  [Ab]\n[Bb]  [Db]  [Ab]\n[Eb]  [Db]  [Ab]\n[Bb]  [Eb]  [E5]\n[F]\n\n[Outro]\n[Bb]\n[F]\n[Bb]\n[F]\n[Bb]\n[F]\n[Bb]",
